OL,3,ASouth African white genocide does not
OL,4,Aexist, new ambassador to US tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Africa's new ambassador to
OL,7,FWashington has a personal reason to
OL,8,Fchallenge Donald Trump's assertion that
OL,9,Fthere is a genocide against white
OL,10,FAfrikaners - he is "a born Afrikaner"
OL,11,Fhimself.
OL,13,F"Is he talking about us?", Roelf Meyer
OL,14,Fremembers thinking, when he first heard
OL,15,FPresident Trump say it.
OL,17,FHis response to the US president's
OL,18,Fclaim is blunt.
